### Test: Gelecekten Gelen Araç
POST http://localhost:5000/api/araclar/ekle
Authorization: Bearer <SENIN_TOKENIN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plaka": "34ABC123",
  "marka": "Tesla",
  "model": "Model S",
  "yil": 2099
}

### Test: Yetkisiz Silme
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/araclar/1
# Authorization başlığı yok!

